  "description": "Shin Yu-ji, granddaughter of Boeun Enterprises chairman. One day, her Kako appears to her while she was living her school life while hiding her identity for her dream of being a writer. As a fallen angel, he is being punished for granting the wishes of 10,000 people at the cafe 'Switch'.\n\nKaco promises to grant her wish. But Yuji refuses to say her wish.\n\nShe eventually gets hired as a part-time job at a cafe 'Switch' in order to grant her wishes, and she works with her to grant the wishes of her humans. The relationship between the two deepens like that, but 'the love between humans and angels' is taboo in heaven. Caco knows it, but she can't deny this feeling, as if it were her destiny.\n\nOne day, Yuji and Kako have the same dream, and they are confused because of the vivid feeling as if they had experienced it firsthand. What kind of past was there between the two, and could their love come true?\n\nAnd what is Yuji's wish? (Translated by Google Translate)\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[KakaoPage](https://page.kakao.com/content/56980111), [Lezhin](https://www.lezhin.com/ko/comic/switch_off), [MrBlue](https://www.mrblue.com/comic/C000048659), [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=6140809), [Ridibooks](https://ridibooks.com/books/4327001303), [Toomics](https://www.toomics.com/webtoon/episode/toon/6710), [Toptoon](https://toptoon.com/comic/ep_list/Turn_off_your_switch)\n[Mootoon](https://www.mootoon.co.kr/comic/moo_list.mg?tcode=5wem), [Qtoon](https://www.qtoon.co.kr/toon/list.mg?tcode=pkdn), [Onestory](https://onestory.co.kr/detail/H040199604), [Nate](https://toonnbook.nate.com/detail/H040199604), [BookCube](https://www.bookcube.com/toon/detail.asp?webtoon_num=220690)\n\n**Official Translations:**  \n[S.Chinese](https://manga.bilibili.com/detail/mc30982), [Japanese](https://jp.piccoma.com/web/product/78166), T.Chinese",
